"""Plain-language help for the "?" button on every figure, table and counter of the report.

Each entry: "what" (what the panel is and why it is there), "read" (axes, colours, symbols; what to look for) and
"watch" (what could mislead). Nothing here is computed; numbers always come from the tables and figures.
"""


def _h(what: str, read: str, watch: str) -> dict[str, str]:
    return {"what": what, "read": read, "watch": watch}


